## Project Implementation Path

### Phase 1: Foundation
- Setup development environment (Arduino IDE, Python)
- Build basic chassis and test motor control
- Implement simple obstacle avoidance

### Phase 2: Object Detection
- Install and configure camera
- Implement basic computer vision for object recognition
- Test detection reliability for target objects

### Phase 3: Object Manipulation
- Build gripper mechanism
- Test object pickup and placement accuracy
- Integrate with detection system

### Phase 4: Vacuum Integration
- Install vacuum motor and collection system
- Design power management for dual functions
- Test combined operations

### Phase 5: Full Integration
- Develop state machine for operational logic
- Optimize power consumption
- Fine-tune and test full prototype

### Phase 6: Refinement
- Add remote control/monitoring capability
- Improve autonomous navigation
- Enhance error handling and recovery

